# Unannotated empty array cannot infer an element type

Verifies an empty array literal without an element type annotation is rejected,
because no element determines the array's element type.

>>> source
let values = []

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: cannot infer the element type of an empty array; add an element type annotation such as `int[]` at Span { start: 13, end: 15 }

<<< exit
1
